<title>FINLAND: SHORT HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE.</title>
<headline>SHORT HELIBOR INTEREST RATES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Short Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>rose at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Wednesday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate rose one bp to 3.04 percent.</p>
<p>			 January 22 fix	January 21 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.02 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.04 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.11 pct		3.11 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.17 pct		3.17 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.25 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
